=A0 concurrent processing</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Core Insight: Reachabi=
lity vs Reference Counting</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Reference counting asks: "How =
many references point to this object?"
Mark-and-sweep asks: "Can I reach this object t=E1=BB=AB program's root obj=
ects?"</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Approach n=C3=A0y elegant v=C3=
=AC:</p>
