b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Circular references don't matte=
r n=E1=BA=BFu entire cycle is unreachable</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Only care about objects that pr=
ogram can actually access</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">More aligned v=E1=BB=9Bi develo=
per mental model</li>
</ul>
