<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">=F0=9F=93=96 Ph=
=E1=BA=A7n III: V8's Sophisticated Garbage Collection</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=
=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation: Why V8 Revolutionized GC</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Khi Google building Chrome, h=E1=
=BB=8D realize r=E1=BA=B1ng traditional garbage collection algorithms kh=C3=
=B4ng sufficient cho modern web applications. Websites becoming complex, ru=
nning longer, v=C3=A0 consuming more memory. V8 team needed breakthrough in=
novations.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Problem Statement: Tra=
ditional GC Limitations</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>1. Pause Times</strong>:=
 Traditional mark-and-sweep could pause application for 100ms+
<strong>2. Memory Inefficiency</strong>: Treating all objects equally waste=
 resources
<strong>3. Allocation Patterns</strong>: Web applications have very specifi=
c memory usage patterns
<strong>4. Performance</strong>: GC overhead could consume 10-30% of execut=
ion time</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Core Insight: Generati=
onal Hypothesis</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">V8's revolution based tr=C3=AAn =
empirical observation called "Generational Hypothesis":</p>
<blockquote class=3D"border-border-200 border-l-4 pl-4">
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>98% of objects die young=
. The remaining 2% live for a long time.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Observation n=C3=A0y came from s=
tudying real web applications v=C3=A0 profiling their memory patterns.</p>
